// Footer - Attribution and links
---

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="footer-description">
      <strong>Alexandria</strong> is a SocioTechnica project. We're building the substrate for humanist
      AI-native organizations.
    </p>
    <p>
      <span class="footer-links">
        <a href="/onboarding">Become an Alexandrian</a>
        <a href="/book">Become an Alpha Reader</a>
        <a href="/agreement">The Agreement</a>
        <a href="https://sociotechnica.org/notebook/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Labnotes</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://github.com/GetAlexandria/alexandria"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
      </span>
    </p>
    <p class="attribution">
      &copy; 2026 <a href="https://sociotechnica.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >SocioTechnica</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(232, 228, 220, 0.06);
    padding: 3rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  footer p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  }

  .footer-description {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .footer-description strong {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  footer a {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  footer a:hover {
    color: var(--color-amber);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .attribution {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .attribution a {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .footer-links {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
